 "description": "<p>The skirt-only version of the bear set: coral fleece in brown, one size for 40-60 kg, with a lace-up front. Buying the piece alone works when the bandeau top from another set already exists in the drawer.</p>\n<p>The lace-up detail is functional - it adjusts the fit through the waist rather than fixing it, which extends the usable range of the one-size cut. Brown fleece reads bear without any accessories at all.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: coral fleece</li>\n<li>Item type: skirt only</li>\n<li>Style: bear</li>\n<li>Color: brown</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Mix it with the white bandeau set or wear it solo - the lace-up holds the look either way.</p>\n",
